s a single piece of clothing and provides more coverage than a [[bikini]]. \r\n\r\n[[School swimsuit]]s and [[competition swimsuit]]s are two of the most common types of one-piece swimsuits. A [[casual one-piece swimsuit]] is any other swimsuit that is not one of these types.\r\n\r\nNote that [[slingshot swimsuit]]s, while technically consisting of a single piece of fabric, are not considered [[one-piece swimsuit]]s.\r\n\r\nh4. Examples\r\n\r\n* !post #4591381\r\n* !post #5641537\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh6. Colors\r\n\r\n* [[aqua one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[black one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[blue one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[brown one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[green one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[grey one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[orange one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[pink one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[purple one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[red one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[white one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[yellow one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[silver one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[gold one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[two-tone one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n\r\nh6. Patterns\r\n\r\n* [[plaid one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[polka dot one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[striped one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[vertical-striped one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n\r\nh6. Styles\r\n\r\n* [[casual one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[competition swimsuit]]\r\n* [[cross-laced one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[double flare skirt one-piece]]\r\n* [[frilled one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[front zipper swimsuit (realise)|]]\r\n* [[highleg one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[off-shoulder one-piece_swimsuit]]\r\n* [[maid one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[sailor one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[school swimsuit]]\r\n* [[see-through one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[side-tie one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[single-shoulder one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[strapless one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[turtleneck one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n\r\nh6. Other\r\n\r\n* [[one-piece swimsuit pull]]\r\n* [[one-piece tan]]\r\n* [[one-piece thong]]\r\n* [[swimsuit aside]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[bikini]]\r\n* 