ptation]] was later produced by [[Netflix]].\r\n\r\nSet in a vast ocean world governed by the elusive World Government. The series follows [[Monkey D. Luffy]] and the crew of the [[Straw Hat Pirates]] in search for the titular \"One Piece\", a treasure said to contain a world-changing power.\r\n\r\nThe series has a spinoff called [[Shokugeki no Sanji]], itself an off-shoot of [[Shokugeki no Souma]].\r\n\r\nh4. Entries\r\n\r\nh6. Main\r\n\r\n* [[one piece: The Movie|The Movie]]\r\n* [[one piece: clockwork island adventure|Clockwork Island Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: dead end adventure|Dead End Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: the cursed holy sword|The Cursed Holy Sword]]\r\n* [[one piece: baron omatsuri and the secret island|Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island]]\r\n* [[one piece: the giant mechanical soldier of karakuri castle|The Giant Mechanical Soldier of Karakuri Castle]]\r\n* [[one piece: strong world|Strong World]]\r\n* [[one piece film: z|Film Z]]\r\n* [[one piece film: gold|Film Gold]]\r\n* [[one piece: stampede|Stampede]]\r\n* [[one piece film: red|Film Red]]\r\n* [[One Piece Film: God Valley]]\r\n\r\nh6. Other\r\n\r\n* [[One Piece (Live Action)]]\r\n* [[One Piece Card Game]]\r\n* [[One Piece Dream Pointer]]\r\n* [[One Piece Everyday]]\r\n* [[One Piece Fan Letter]]\r\n* [[One Piece Heroines]]\r\n* [[One Piece Straw Hat Space]]\r\n* [[One Piece Treasure Cruise]]\r\n* [[Shokugeki no Sanji]]\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\n* [[Monkey D. Luffy|]]\r\n* [[Roronoa Zoro]]\r\n* [[Nami (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Usopp]]\r\n* [[Sanji (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Tony Tony Chopper]]\r\n* [[Nico Robin]]\r\n* [[Franky (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Brook (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Jinbe (one piece)|]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh6. Organizations & Groups\r\n\r\n* [[Baroque Works]]\r\n* [[CP9]]\r\n* [[Eleven Supernova]]\r\n* [[Gorosei]]\r\n* [[Impel Down]]\r\n* [[Shichibukai]]\r\n* [[Whitebeard Pirates]]\r\n* [[Celestial Dragons (One Piece)|]]\r\n\r\nh6. Objects and Powers\r\n\r\n* [[Devil Fruit]]\r\n* [[Den Den Mushi]]\r\n* [[Haki (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Log Pose]]\r\n\r\nh6. Locations\r\n\r\n* [[Enies Lobby]]\r\n* [[Impel Down]]\r\n* [[Marineford]]\r\n* [[Shabondi]]\r\n* [[Thriller Bark]]\r\n\r\nh6. Memes\r\n\r\n* [[Blackbeard writing (meme)]]\r\n* [[Chopper crying (meme)]]\r\n* [[Enel face (meme)]]\r\n* [[He laughed (meme)]]\r\n* [[I want to live (meme)]]\r\n* [[The One Piece is real (meme)]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[List of One Piece characters]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Official Twitter\":https://twitter.com/OPcom_info/\r\n* \"Wikipedia: One Piece\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"one_piece"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"14033"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:8784","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:8784","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:8784","original":"A [[pirate costume|pirate]] adventure manga and anime series drawn by [[Oda Eiichirou]]. It started in 1997 and it is the best-selling manga of all time. An animated adaptation was produced by [[Toei Company]] and a [[one piece (live action)|live action adaptation]] was later produced by [[Netflix]].\r\n\r\nSet in a vast ocean world governed by the elusive World Government. The series follows [[Monkey D. Luffy]] and the crew of the [[Straw Hat Pirates]] in search for the titular \"One Piece\", a treasure said to contain a world-changing power.\r\n\r\nThe series has a spinoff called [[Shokugeki no Sanji]], itself an off-shoot of [[Shokugeki no Souma]].\r\n\r\nh4. Entries\r\n\r\nh6. Main\r\n\r\n* [[one piece: The Movie|The Movie]]\r\n* [[one piece: clockwork island adventure|Clockwork Island Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: dead end adventure|Dead End Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: the cursed holy sword|The Cursed Holy Sword]]\r\n* [[one piece: baron omatsuri and the secret island|Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island]]\r\n* [[one piece: the giant mechanical soldier of karakuri castle|The Giant Mechanical Soldier of Karakuri Castle]]\r\n* [[one piece: strong world|Strong World]]\r\n* [[one piece film: z|Film Z]]\r\n* [[one piece film: gold|Film Gold]]\r\n* [[one piece: stampede|Stampede]]\r\n* [[one piece film: red|Film Red]]\r\n* [[One Piece Film: God Valley]]\r\n\r\nh6. Other\r\n\r\n* [[One Piece (Live Action)]]\r\n* [[One Piece Card Game]]\r\n* [[One Piece Dream Pointer]]\r\n* [[One Piece Everyday]]\r\n* [[One Piece Fan Letter]]\r\n* [[One Piece Heroines]]\r\n* [[One Piece Straw Hat Space]]\r\n* [[One Piece Treasure Cruise]]\r\n* [[Shokugeki no Sanji]]\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\n* [[Monkey D. Luffy|]]\r\n* [[Roronoa Zoro]]\r\n* [[Nami (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Usopp]]\r\n* [[Sanji (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Tony Tony Chopper]]\r\n* [[Nico Robin]]\r\n* [[Franky (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Brook (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Jinbe (one piece)|]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh6. Organizations & Groups\r\n\r\n* [[Baroque Works]]\r\n* [[CP9]]\r\n* [[Eleven Supernova]]\r\n* [[Gorosei]]\r\n* [[Impel Down]]\r\n* [[Shichibukai]]\r\n* [[Whitebeard Pirates]]\r\n* [[Celestial Dragons (One Piece)|]]\r\n\r\nh6. Objects and Powers\r\n\r\n* [[Devil Fruit]]\r\n* [[Den Den Mushi]]\r\n* [[Haki (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Log Pose]]\r\n\r\nh6. Locations\r\n\r\n* [[Enies Lobby]]\r\n* [[Impel Down]]\r\n* [[Marineford]]\r\n* [[Shabondi]]\r\n* [[Thriller Bark]]\r\n\r\nh6. Memes\r\n\r\n* [[Blackbeard writing (meme)]]\r\n* [[Chopper crying (meme)]]\r\n* [[Enel face (meme)]]\r\n* [[He laughed (meme)]]\r\n* [[I want to live (meme)]]\r\n* [[The One Piece is real (meme)]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[List of One Piece characters]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Official Twitter\":https://twitter.com/OPcom_info/\r\n* \"Wikipedia: One Piece\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","title":"one_piece"}],"score":-19.13320782769236,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","original":"One of the strongest [[pirate costume|pirate]] crews in the world of [[One Piece]], with several ships, 16 divisions, and a large number of allies.\r\n\r\n[spoiler]After the deaths of [[Portgas D. Ace|Ace]] and [[Edward Newgate|Whitebeard]] at [[Marineford]], their current activities are unknown.[/spoiler]\r\n\r\n[b]Captain:[/b]\r\n[[Edward Newgate]] \"Whitebeard\"\r\n\r\n[b]Division Commanders:[/b]\r\n1st: [[Marco (one piece)|]]\r\n2nd: [[Portgas D. Ace]]\r\n3rd: [[Jozu (one piece)|]]\r\n4th: [[Thatch (one piece)|]] (deceased)\r\n5th: [[Flower Sword Vista]]\r\n6th: [[Blamenco]]\r\n7th: [[Rakuyou (one piece)|]]\r\n8th: [[Namur (one piece)|]]\r\n9th: [[Blenheim]]\r\n10th: [[Curiel (one piece)|]]\r\n11th: [[Kingdew]]\r\n12th: [[Haruta (one piece)|]]\r\n13th: [[Atmos (one piece)|]]\r\n14th: [[Speed Jiru]]\r\n15th: [[Fossa (one piece)|]]\r\n16th: [[Izou (one piece)|]]\r\n\r\n[b]Allies:[/b]\r\nA.O\r\nAgsilly\r\nAmadob\r\nAndre\r\nArthur\r\nBaggaley\r\n[[Bizarre (one piece)|]]\r\nBlondie\r\nBrew\r\nBrocca\r\nCands\r\nChoi\r\nColscon\r\nDecalvan Brothers\r\nDelacuaji\r\n[[Doma (one piece)|]]\r\nElmy\r\nEpoida\r\nForliewbs\r\nGreat Michael\r\nHangan\r\nHappygun\r\nIslewan\r\n[[Jinbe (one piece)|]]\r\nJulius\r\nKarma\r\nKechatch\r\nKinga\r\nLittle Oars Jr.\r\nMcGuy\r\nNinth\r\nNosgari\r\n[[Palms (one piece)|]]\r\nPavlik\r\nRamba\r\nReforte\r\nRush\r\nSleepy\r\n[[Squardo]]\r\nVitan\r\nWallem\r\n[[Whitey Bay]]\r\nZodia\r\nZucca\r\n\r\n[b]Others:[/b]\r\nChameleone (non-canon)\r\n[[Marshall D. Teach]] (defected)\r\n[[Moby Dick (One Piece)|]] (flagship)\r\n[[Stefan (one piece)|]] (pet)","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"whitebeard_pirates"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"50190"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","original":"One of the strongest [[pirate costume|pirate]] crews in the world of [[One Piece]], with several ships, 16 divisions, and a large number of allies.\r\n\r\n[spoiler]After the deaths of [[Portgas D. Ace|Ace]] and [[Edward Newgate|Whitebeard]] at [[Marineford]], their current activities are unknown.[/spoiler]\r\n\r\n[b]Captain:[/b]\r\n[[Edward Newgate]] \"Whitebeard\"\r\n\r\n[b]Division Commanders:[/b]\r\n1st: [[Marco (one piece)|]]\r\n2nd: [[Portgas D. Ace]]\r\n3rd: [[Jozu (one piece)|]]\r\n4th: [[Thatch (one piece)|]] (deceased)\r\n5th: [[Flower Sword Vista]]\r\n6th: [[Blamenco]]\r\n7th: [[Rakuyou (one piece)|]]\r\n8th: [[Namur (one piece)|]]\r\n9th: [[Blenheim]]\r\n10th: [[Curiel (one piece)|]]\r\n11th: [[Kingdew]]\r\n12th: [[Haruta (one piece)|]]\r\n13th: [[Atmos (one piece)|]]\r\n14th: [[Speed Jiru]]\r\n15th: [[Fossa (one piece)|]]\r\n16th: [[Izou (one piece)|]]\r\n\r\n[b]Allies:[/b]\r\nA.O\r\nAgsilly\r\nAmadob\r\nAndre\r\nArthur\r\nBaggaley\r\n[[Bizarre (one piece)|]]\r\nBlondie\r\nBrew\r\nBrocca\r\nCands\r\nChoi\r\nColscon\r\nDecalvan Brothers\r\nDelacuaji\r\n[[Doma (one piece)|]]\r\nElmy\r\nEpoida\r\nForliewbs\r\nGreat Michael\r\nHangan\r\nHappygun\r\nIslewan\r\n[[Jinbe (one piece)|]]\r\nJulius\r\nKarma\r\nKechatch\r\nKinga\r\nLittle Oars Jr.\r\nMcGuy\r\nNinth\r\nNosgari\r\n[[Palms (one piece)|]]\r\nPavlik\r\nRamba\r\nReforte\r\nRush\r\nSleepy\r\n[[Squardo]]\r\nVitan\r\nWallem\r\n[[Whitey Bay]]\r\nZodia\r\nZucca\r\n\r\n[b]Others:[/b]\r\nChameleone (non-canon)\r\n[[Marshall D. Teach]] (defected)\r\n[[Moby Dick (One Piece)|]] (flagship)\r\n[[Stefan (one piece)|]] (pet)","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","title":"whitebeard_pirates"}],"score":-18.93167437213189,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45667","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45667","original":"An organisation in [[One Piece]]. Led by [[Donquixote Doflamingo]], the Donquixote Family (also known as the Donquixote Pirates) are a powerful group in the underground, supplying weapons and ruling Dressrosa with an iron fist.\r\n\r\nThey are mainly organized into groups named after the card suits. Doflamingo had intended for [[Trafalgar Law]] to take on the role of Corazon (heart), but Law had other plans.\r\n\r\n[b]Commando Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Pica (one piece)|]] (Spade)\r\n* [[Gladius (One Piece)|Gladius]]\r\n* [[Buffalo (One Piece)|Buffalo]]\r\n* [[Baby 5]]\r\n\r\n[b]Fighting Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Diamante (one piece)|]] (Diamond)\r\n* [[Lao G (one Piece)|]]\r\n* [[Machvise]]\r\n* [[Senor Pink]]\r\n* [[dellinger_(one_piece)|Dellinger]]\r\n\r\n[b]Special Powers Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Trebol (one piece)|]] (Club)\r\n* [[Sugar (One Piece)|Sugar]]\r\n* [[Giolla]]\r\n* [[Viola (one Piece)|Violet]]\r\n\r\n[b]Others or members belonging to unknown units:[/b]\r\n* [[Donquixote Rocinante]] (deceased)\r\n* [[Vergo (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Monet (One Piece)|Monet]]\r\n* [[Caesar Clown]]\r\n* [[Bellamy (one piece)|]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"donquixote_family"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"51789"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45667","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45667","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45667","original":"An organisation in [[One Piece]]. Led by [[Donquixote Doflamingo]], the Donquixote Family (also known as the Donquixote Pirates) are a powerful group in the underground, supplying weapons and ruling Dressrosa with an iron fist.\r\n\r\nThey are mainly organized into groups named after the card suits. Doflamingo had intended for [[Trafalgar Law]] to take on the role of Corazon (heart), but Law had other plans.\r\n\r\n[b]Commando Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Pica (one piece)|]] (Spade)\r\n* [[Gladius (One Piece)|Gladius]]\r\n* [[Buffalo (One Piece)|Buffalo]]\r\n* [[Baby 5]]\r\n\r\n[b]Fighting Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Diamante (one piece)|]] (Diamond)\r\n* [[Lao G (one Piece)|]]\r\n* [[Machvise]]\r\n* [[Senor Pink]]\r\n* [[dellinger_(one_piece)|Dellinger]]\r\n\r\n[b]Special Powers Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Trebol (one piece)|]] (Club)\r\n* [[Sugar (One Piece)|Sugar]]\r\n* [[Giolla]]\r\n* [[Viola (one Piece)|Violet]]\r\n\r\n[b]Others or members belonging to unknown units:[/b]\r\n* [[Donquixote Rocinante]] (deceased)\r\n* [[Vergo (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Monet (One Piece)|Monet]]\r\n* [[Caesar Clown]]\r\n* [[Bellamy (one piece)|]]","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","title":"donquixote_family"}],"score":-18.819104392361453,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45686","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45686","original":"A group of impostors in [[One Piece]] that masqueraded as the Straw Hat Pirates.\r\n\r\nh4. Members\r\n* [b]Captain:[/b] [[Demalo Black]] (posed as [[Monkey D. Luffy|Luffy]])\r\n* [[Manjaro (one piece)|]] (posed as [[Roronoa Zoro|Zoro]])\r\n* [[Chocolat (one piece)|]] (posed as [[Nami (one piece)|]])\r\n* [[Mounblutain]] (posed as [[Sogeking]])\r\n* [[Drip (one piece)|]] (posed as [[Sanji (one piece)|]])\r\n* [[Nora Gitsune]] (posed as [[Tony tony chopper|Chopper]])\r\n* [[Cocoa (one piece)|]] (posed as [[Nico Robin|Robin]])\r\n* [[Turco]] (posed as [[Franky (one piece)|]])","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"fake_straw_hat_