ilver one-piece swimsuit]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"gold_one-piece_swimsuit"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"147894"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:141568","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:141568","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:141568","original":"A [[one-piece swimsuit]] that is colored gold.\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[gold bikini]]\r\n* [[yellow one-piece swimsuit]] \r\n* [[silver one-piece swimsuit]]","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","title":"gold_one-piece_swimsuit"}],"score":-18.71462704614163,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:240","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:240","original":"A garment worn for [[swimming]], [[bathing]], and [[beach]] activities. \r\n\r\nFemale swimwear is usually made of tight-fitting stretch fabric, either [[one-piece_swimsuit|one]] or [[bikini|two-piece]].\r\n\r\n[[Male swimwear]] typically covers the crotch area only and can be loose ([[swim trunks|trunks]]) or tight-fitting ([[swim briefs|briefs]], [[legskin]], or [[jammers]]).\r\n\r\nh4. Examples\r\n\r\n* !post #7622269: [[One-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* !post #7622268: [[Bikini]]\r\n* !post #5597913: [[Slingshot swimsuit]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh6. Types of swimsuits\r\n\r\n* [[Bikini]]\r\n** [[Bikini skirt]]\r\n** [[Checkered bikini]]\r\n** [[Leaf bikini]]\r\n** [[Lowleg bikini]]\r\n** [[Maid bikini]]\r\n** [[Micro bikini]]\r\n** [[O-ring bikini]]\r\n*** [[O-ring top]]\r\n*** [[O-ring bottom]]\r\n** [[Shell bikini]]\r\n** [[Side-tie bikini bottom]]\r\n** [[Sports bikini]]\r\n** [[String bikini]]\r\n** [[Tankini]]\r\n** [[Thong bikini]]\r\n* [[Rash guard]] (swim shirt)\r\n* [[Old-fashioned swimsuit]]\r\n* [[One-piece swimsuit]]\r\n** [[Casual one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n*** [[Dress swimsuit]]\r\n** [[Competition swimsuit]]\r\n** [[Gris Swimsuit]]\r\n** [[Monokini]]\r\n** [[School swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Slingshot swimsuit]] (sling bikini)\r\n\r\nh6. Styles\r\n\r\n* [[Bow swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Frilled one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Frilled bikini]]\r\n* [[Highleg one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Highleg bikini]]\r\n* [[Polka dot swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Polka dot bikini]]\r\n* [[Striped one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Striped bikini]]\r\n* [[G-string]]/[[Thong]] (may also relate to underwear)\r\n\r\nh6. Colors\r\n\r\n* [[Aqua one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Black one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Blue one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Brown one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Green one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Grey one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Orange one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Pink one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Red one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Purple one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[White one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Yellow one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Gold one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Silver one-piece swimsuit]]\r\n\r\nh6. Male swimwear\r\n\r\n* [[Jammers]]\r\n* [[Legskin]]\r\n* [[Swim briefs]]\r\n* [[Swim trunks]]\r\n* [[Loincloth]] and [[fundoshi]] (may also relate to underwear)\r\n\r\nh6. Other swimsuit-related tags\r\n\r\n* [[Adjusting swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Bikini top lift]]\r\n* [[Bikini bottom only]]\r\n* [[Bikini top only]]\r\n* [[Hand under swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Impossible swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Swim cap]]\r\n* [[Swimsuit aside]]\r\n** [[Bikini bottom aside]]\r\n* [[Swimsuit costume]]\r\n* [[One-piece swimsuit pull]]\r\n* [[Bikini bottom pull]]\r\n* [[Bikini top pull]]\r\n* [[Swimsuit under clothes]]\r\n** [[Nearly naked apron]] \r\n** [[Swimsuit cover-up]]\r\n* [[Torn swimsuit]]\r\n* [[Sarong]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Tag Group:Attire]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"swimsuit"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"3832"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:240","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:240","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:240","original":"A garment worn for [[swimming]], [[bathing]], and [[beach]] activities. \r\n\r\nFemale swimwear is usually made of tight-fitting stretch fabric, either [[one-piece_swimsuit|one]] or [[bikini|two-piece]].\r\n\r\n[[Male swimwear]] typically covers the crotch area only and can be loose ([[swim trunks|trunks]]) or tight-fitting ([[swim briefs|briefs]], [[legskin]], or [[jammers]]).\r\n\r\nh4. Examples\r\n\r\n* !post #7622269: [[One-piece swimsuit]]\r\n* !post #7622268: [[Bikini]]\r\n* !post #5597913: [[Slingshot swimsuit]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh6. Types of swimsuits\r\n\r\n* [[Bikini]]\r\n** [[Bikini skirt]]\r\n** [[Checkered bikini]]\r\n** [[Leaf bikini]]\r\n** [[Lowleg bikini]]\r\n** [[Maid bikini]]\r\n** [[Micro b