393","original":"A criminal group led by [[Crocodile (One Piece)|]] in the world of [[One Piece]]. Disbanded.\r\n\r\nThey paired up male and female agents and relied on codenames to keep their operations secret. The lower an agents number the higher up in the organisation were they.\r\n\r\n[b]Top Members:[/b]\r\n[[Crocodile (one Piece)|Mr.0]] & [[Nico Robin|Miss All-Sunday]]\r\n\r\n[b]Officer Agents:[/b]\r\n[[Daz Bones|Mr.1]] & [[paula (one piece)|Miss Doublefinger]]\r\n[[Bon Clay|Mr.2 Bon Clay]] (no partner)\r\n[[Galdino|Mr.3]] & [[Miss Goldenweek]]\r\n[[mister four (one piece)|Mr.4]] & [[Miss Merry Christmas]]\r\n[[mister five (one piece)|Mr.5]] & [[Miss Valentine]]\r\n\r\n[b]Frontier Agents:[/b]\r\nMr.6 & Miss Mother's Day\r\n[[Mister Seven (one Piece)|Mr.7]] & [[Miss Father's Day]]\r\n[[Igaram|Mr.8]] & [[Miss Monday]]\r\n[[Mister Nine (one Piece)|Mr.9]] & [[Nefertari Vivi|Miss Wednesday]]\r\nMr.10 & Miss Tuesday\r\n[[Mister Eleven (one Piece)|Mr.11]] & Miss Thursday\r\n\r\n[b]The Unluckies:[/b]\r\n[[mister thirteen (one piece)|Mr.13]] & [[miss Friday]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"baroque_works"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"49504"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:43393","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:43393","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:43393","original":"A criminal group led by [[Crocodile (One Piece)|]] in the world of [[One Piece]]. Disbanded.\r\n\r\nThey 