] character. Member of the Nine Red Scabbards. Friend of [[Kinemon]].\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"One Piece Wiki: Denjiro\":https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Denjiro","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","title":"denjirou_(one_piece)"}],"score":-17.885489437533145,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:680744","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:680744","original":"このたび『ONE PIECE FILM RED』(2022年公開)以来の映画最新作、『ONE PIECE FILM GOD VALLEY』が2027年夏に公開することが決定！　さらに2029年には『ONE PIECE FILM BAAD』の公開も決定しました!!\r\n\r\n2027年7月22日(木)に記念すべき連載30周年を迎える『ONE PIECE』。\r\n『ONE PIECE FILM GOD VALLEY』はまさにアニバーサリーイヤーでの公開にふさわしいタイトルとなっています。\r\n\r\nさらに、2029年10月20日(土)にはTVアニメ『ONE PIECE』の放送も30周年を迎えますが、この記念すべき年にも『ONE PIECE FILM BAAD』を公開します。\r\nこちらの『ONE PIECE FILM BAAD』のタイトル画像は尾田先生直筆です！\r\n\r\nぜひ今後の続報もお楽しみに!!","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"ONE PIECE FILM BAAD"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"subject","namespace":"bangumi.subject","value":"697174"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:680744","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:680744","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"subject"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:680744","original":"このたび『ONE PIECE FILM RED』(2022年公開)以来の映画最新作、『ONE PIECE FILM GOD VALLEY』が2027年夏に公開することが決定！　さらに2029年には『ONE PIECE FILM BAAD』の公開も決定しました!!\r\n\r\n2027年7月22日(木)に記念すべき連載30周年を迎える『ONE PIECE』。\r\n『ONE PIECE FILM GOD VALLEY』はまさにアニバーサリーイヤーでの公開にふさわしいタイトルとなっています。\r\n\r\nさらに、2029年10月20日(土)にはTVアニメ『ONE PIECE』の放送も30周年を迎えますが、この記念すべき年にも『ONE PIECE FILM BAAD』を公開します。\r\nこちらの『ONE PIECE FILM BAAD』のタイトル画像は尾田先生直筆です！\r\n\r\nぜひ今後の続報もお楽しみに!!","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","title":"ONE PIECE FILM BAAD"}],"score":-17.84810952371881,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:107916","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:107916","original":"[[One Piece]] character.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"who's_who_(one_piece)"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"114242"},"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:107916","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:107916","locator":null,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","type":"page"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:107916","original":"[[One Piece]] character.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd4